🔐 Password Strength Classification
A machine learning project that classifies passwords into categories such as weak, medium, and strong.
The workflow focuses on transforming raw text passwords into meaningful numerical features and evaluating different classification models.

📌 Features

Text preprocessing and cleaning

Character-level feature extraction

Password vectorization techniques

Training and comparison of multiple ML models

Performance evaluation and metric analysis

🛠 Tools Used
Python · Pandas · NumPy · Scikit-learn · Jupyter Notebook

📁 Main File
Password Strength.ipynb — full preprocessing pipeline, model training, and evaluation
